&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable navigating ambiguity, driving work independently as a senior contributor, and constructively challenging senior stakeholders to get the best result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a continuous improvement mindset and love solving complex, structural problems to build frameworks that scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
