&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Solutioning &amp;amp; GTM Leader for Data &amp;amp; AI service line is a senior, industry-facing commercial leader responsible for originating, shaping, solutioning and driving large-scale Data &amp;amp; AI transformation opportunities in Europe, Middle East and India, with key focus on large and complex AI deals, solutioning and delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is accountable for building and converting a pipeline of $3–5M+ TCV opportunities, materially contributing to annual $30M+ in bookings, by driving Data &amp;amp; AI opportunity development, pursuit strategy, and deal shaping across key markets and accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client Partners retain overall account ownership and commercial closure responsibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role owns the development &amp;amp; progression of the specialist Data &amp;amp; AI opportunity space within the market/accounts, leading how opportunities are identified, framed,, including the client problem, transformation agenda, value case, proposition and solution direction - and progressed into high-value, outcome-led transformation programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The focus is on driving platform-centric, enterprise-scale Data &amp;amp; AI programs that move beyond fragmented data initiatives and isolated AI pilots toward scalable, AI-ready data foundations that deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role operates as a leader among leaders in complex pursuits, working closely with Client Partners, Business Development, Practice Leaders, architects, and delivery teams to shape differentiated commercially viable, executable programs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Role Profile Summary:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is measured by its ability to drive top-line growth by owning and scaling Data &amp;amp; AI opportunities within the vertical. Success comes from combining Data &amp;amp; AI expertise, transformation thinking and strong commercial acumen to identify and develop opportunities, shape compelling propositions and solutions, building and progressing a high-quality pipeline, larger and more strategic deals, and ensuring those deals translate into executable, high-impact programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; AI Pipeline Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the origination, qualification, development and progression of Data &amp;amp; AI opportunities. Build and maintain a pipeline capable of delivering $30M+ in bookings, anchored on $3–5M+ deal sizes, shifting composition toward strategic, transformation-led programs rather than fragmented work.Build pipeline across the full spectrum — data platforms, governance, and AI — working with clients and account teams to translate emerging needs into defined transformation opportunities.&amp;nbsp; Shape opportunities as integrated data-to-AI value chains rather than siloed initiatives, defining the client problem, intended business outcomes, transformation pathway and relevant Data &amp;amp; AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pursuit &amp;amp; Deal Shaping: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the shaping of complex Data &amp;amp; AI pursuits, owning the client narrative, business case, transformation agenda, and value proposition, solution direction and commercial framing. Drive opportunity progression and materially influence conversion, deal size, and win rates.Lead solutioning that connects data foundations with AI capabilities into one coherent transformation narrative, strengthening technical credibility and deal differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Client Advisory &amp;amp; Opportunity Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Build trusted executive relationships in partnership with account leadership with senior client stakeholders including CDOs, CIOs, CTOs, and Heads of AI. Lead executive conversations on how Data &amp;amp; AI investments translate into business outcomes such as growth, efficiency, and risk reduction.Advise executives on how data readiness underpins successful AI adoption, helping sequence investment across the data-to-AI maturity curve.Use Data &amp;amp; AI expertise to explore client challenges, identify potential value and help define where a viable transformation opportunity exists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEI Data &amp;amp; AI Growth Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Support the Data &amp;amp; AI growth agenda in EMEI. Identify priority accounts, whitespace, and repeatable plays that scale Data &amp;amp; AI revenue, grounded in real client problems and market demand.Identify whitespace across the integrated stack — data platforms and AI capabilities — with go-to-market plays that show a clear path from one to the next.Translate recurring client needs and market insight into repeatable transformation propositions, plays and opportunity patterns that strengthen the Data &amp;amp; AI pipeline across markets and accounts.Partner with Client Partners&amp;nbsp; to focus Data &amp;amp; AI effort where it can create the greatest client and growth opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution &amp;amp; Offering Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with Practice Leaders, Ecosystem teams, architects, and SMEs to shape solutions that are differentiated, relevant, and grounded in delivery capability. Connect data platforms, governance, AI/ML, and agentic enterprise data foundations to tangible business outcomes. Requires hands-on experience with Agentic AI solutions and use case execution.Maintain a reusable library spanning data architecture and AI solution patterns to speed up assembly of end-to-end offerings.Partner with architects on feasibility across the stack — data integration, model selection, and tooling — to ensure proposed solutions are deliverable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery Alignment &amp;amp; Expansion: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with Practice Leaders to ensure opportunities are deliverable with quality and predictability, validating feasibility prior to closure. Drive land-and-expand opportunities that extend engagements into broader transformation programs.Grow initial data or AI engagements into broader integrated data-and-AI transformation programs over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Leadership &amp;amp; Market Positioning: &lt;/strong&gt;Operate as part of the Data &amp;amp; AI leadership team, shaping strategy, targets, and vertical plays. Contribute to Thoughtworks&#39; external positioning through industry-relevant narratives and insights.Represent Thoughtworks&#39; point of view on integrated data and AI transformation, grounded in how strong data foundations enable successful AI outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of originating and shaping large ($3-5M+) consulting or transformation deals and opportunities in Data &amp;amp; AI or adjacent domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with the ability to build pipeline, shape deals, and drive conversion through Data &amp;amp; AI opportunities and transformation leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior industry or consulting experience with credibility at executive levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how Data &amp;amp; AI capabilities translate into business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate within account structures, owning development and progression domain opportunities while collaborating with Client Partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration with Practice Leaders to ensure solutions are both compelling and deliverable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive communication, storytelling, and negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in business value delivery and ROI generation with advanced AI solutions across industries e.g. BFSI, Manufacturing, Travel, Telecom, Media, Gaming, Life Sciences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical understanding across the data and AI stack — platforms, governance, and AI/ML — sufficient to independently explore client problems, define transformation opportunities, establish solution direction and work&amp;nbsp; credibly with technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to articulate value cases spanning data modernization and AI adoption, showing a connected path from data investment to AI-driven outcomes. Ability to move between executive business conversations and technical discussions, translating client needs into transformation opportunities that are commercially compelling and technically credible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Key Outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribution to $30M+ in bookings through ownership and progression and shaping of high value Data &amp;amp; AI opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustained pipeline of multiple $3–5M+ deals across geography and industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increased average deal size and improved conversion of Data &amp;amp; AI opportunities through strong opportunity definition, transformation shaping, value articulation and technical credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth in enterprise-scale, outcome-led Data &amp;amp; AI transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong alignment between sold work and delivery outcomes, enabling repeatable success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth in integrated data-and-AI deals (platforms and AI/ML) as a share of overall pipeline and bookings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increased reuse of successful Data &amp;amp; AI propositions, transformation patterns and solution approaches across markets and accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking to expand our Go-To-Market team in RCTT (short for Retail, Consumer, Travel and Transportation) in Europe with a special focus on the Retail sector in the UK&amp;amp;I.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, we are looking for a leader who is experienced with selling and delivering digital transformations encompassing our core offerings of Customer Experience, Product Innovation, Enterprise Platform Modernization, Data Modernization, AI Readiness, Engineering Excellence and Digital Application and Maintenance Operations (DAMO).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be inheriting one large portfolio in the Retail space based on which you will grow the existing account, and acquire new accounts based on your network, your industry expertise and our marketing activities and in close collaboration with your account team, our industry and service line specialists and the RCTT market organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Client Principals, you are responsible for the entire sales cycle (lead generation through proposal, contract negotiation and closure) as well as client relationship management, account strategy and planning, joint delivery governance and project reviews.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This includes e.g.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Understand the industry context, the customer problem and define mutual value ● Develop and execute on key account plans and overall go-to-market&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Acquire and nurture senior client relationships on strategic accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Achieve established revenue and profitability targets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Work closely with the account leadership team (consisting e.g. of the account tech director and account delivery director)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Actively participate in the go-to-market plan creation/refinement for your account as well as for the industry vertical (RCTT), and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Report account activity, opportunity status and other details to the RCTT leadership (portfolio director)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Establish, build, and maintain long-term, value-based relationships with a growing number of senior client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Farm and manage between one and three accounts at a time (including 1-2 prospect accounts).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Drive $20 million to $50 million in revenue per year from accounts to meet or exceed profitability targets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the creation and execution of existing account strategies, and build “win-win” value propositions at the company and individual levels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop a range of IP and best practices around client and portfolio development in order to build the client base into a significant strategic asset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach client executives as true business partners versus software delivery partners, expanding the company’s breadth and depth to its full potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work on continuous margin improvement in sold and delivered margin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;A deep understanding of the retail (and ideally also the consumer goods) industry, familiarity with the main industry trends and drivers as well as relevant players (e.g. eco-system partners).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong network in the industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience working in many different executive revenue-generating roles requiring strong business acumen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success managing and developing sophisticated senior client relationships and strategic business partnerships across the C-suite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to a clients’ business using a highly consultative and solution-oriented approach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive thought leadership and innovation experience for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence decisions by bringing in relevant industry trends and client stories on innovation and digital disruption.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in agile (custom) software development project delivery with the ability to understand the momentum of technical projects and the challenges a highly technical team will face in project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;A strategic thinker, with the ability to translate concepts and ideas into practical and tactical action and the skills to create value propositions for clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;A goal-oriented self-starter, with strong consultative instincts and skills who quickly and easily establishes rapport and credibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable seeking out and interfacing with external constituents, and has the personal and social attributes to create and then manage effective long-lasting relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Skilled at negotiation and working in an ecosystem with external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Must be able to craft visions and adopt progressive points of view regarding the future, and rally people around the agendas that drive change.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinks strategically, but also is highly skilled at execution in a complex environment with multiple stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leader who inspires and grows a team who understands what it means to “put the team over self” .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;The ability to lead and motivate account and software development teams with creativity,imagination, energy, and enthusiasm.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important things to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Projects are almost exclusively on customer site, so candidates should be flexible and open to travel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not quite ready to apply? Or maybe this isn’t the right role for you? That’s OK, you can stay in touch with our digital leaders by joining Perspectives, our network for business insights in technology&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is the policy of ThoughtWorks, Inc. to provide a work environment free of discrimination. The Company will take affirmative action to ensure applicants and ThoughtWorks employees are treated without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, ethnic origin, veteran status, family status, disability, sexual orientation, gender expression or gender identity. This also includes individuals who are perceived to have any of the aforementioned attributes. ThoughtWorks will adhere to all federal, state, and municipal laws and regulations governing employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Director of Specialty Fibers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role ensures that every product made from cashmere, merino, yak, alpaca, and other luxury fibers meets Quince&#39;s uncompromising standards for quality, sustainability, and affordability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director blends deep technical expertise in fiber science with strategic supply chain leadership and cross-functional collaboration, serving as the central hub connecting sourcing, production, quality, and design teams across global markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Strategic Leadership &amp;amp; Supply Chain Management&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate the end-to-end supply chain as the central hub connecting sourcing managers, production teams, and quality specialists to ensure a seamless, resilient, and efficient flow from fiber to finished yarn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor a diverse, specialized team of sourcing managers, quality engineers, and production experts, fostering a culture of continuous improvement and technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive multi-sourcing and nearshoring strategies to mitigate geopolitical and logistical risks while ensuring a stable supply of high-grade fibers from the Americas and Asia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the strategic direction for vertical integration opportunities, evaluating build-vs-buy decisions for spinning, dyeing, or finishing capabilities that could enhance quality control and margin structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key advisor to the executive team on fiber market trends, geopolitical risks (e.g., trade tariffs, export restrictions), climate impacts on raw material supply, and competitive intelligence—translating complex data into actionable business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion Quince&#39;s &quot;unreal prices&quot; mission by continuously identifying cost-leadership opportunities across the supply chain, from farm to finished yarn, without compromising ethical standards or product integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Supplier Development&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and curate a best-in-class supplier ecosystem, identifying, vetting, and onboarding mills, dehairers, spinners, and dye houses that meet Quince&#39;s exacting standards for quality, capacity, sustainability, and labor practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead supplier development programs, coaching strategic partners to improve yield, reduce defects, adopt sustainable practices, and achieve cost efficiencies that benefit both parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive traceability and transparency across the entire fiber supply chain, from herder cooperatives and farms to finished yarn. Partner with certification bodies (GOTS, RWS, GCS, ZQ) to ensure chain-of-custody integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make high-stakes sourcing decisions based on deep market intelligence—including auction prices, crop forecasts, currency fluctuations, and geopolitical developments—balancing short-term cost opportunities with long-term relationship value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Quality Assurance &amp;amp; Technical Optimization&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect the quality management system for all specialty fibers, defining standards, testing protocols, and approval workflows for raw fiber, dehaired fiber, tops, yarns, and finished goods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Senior Manager, Natural Fibers Quality to establish measurable quality benchmarks, including micron distribution, fiber length, tensile strength, yield, color fastness, and pilling resistance—ensuring every lot meets or exceeds luxury brand parity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee third-party lab testing and compliance, working with the Cashmere Spec/Test Report/Compliance Auditor to validate that all materials meet international standards (ISO, OEKO-TEX, GOTS, REACH) and Quince&#39;s internal specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead root-cause analysis for quality failures, implementing corrective and preventive actions (CAPA) across the supply chain. Drive a culture of &quot;quality at the source,&quot; empowering suppliers to self-detect and correct issues before production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product development and design teams to translate aesthetic and tactile visions into technical specifications—micron targets, twist levels, finishing treatments—that are manufacturable at scale and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the central point of communication for all fiber-related matters, providing technical expertise and clear direction to design, product development, and production teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate daily with domestic and overseas mills, dye houses, and suppliers to give precise, actionable feedback on fiber quality, color accuracy, availability and production timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate design and merchandising visions into clear, manufacturable technical briefs for suppliers, ensuring that product aesthetics and performance meet Quince&#39;s brand standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead blind panels with design, merchandising, and customer focus groups to validate luxury fiber perception and color accuracy before commercialization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Required&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Textile Science, Fiber Engineering, Material Science, Supply Chain Management, Color Chemistry, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in specialty fiber sourcing, yarn production, quality management, or coloration for apparel, accessories, or home textiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical knowledge of natural fibers (cashmere, merino, yak, alpaca, cotton), spinning processes (woolen, worsted)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience managing cross-functional teams in a fast-paced retail or manufacturing environment, with a track record of mentoring and developing talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cost analysis skills: cost-per-kilogram modeling, yield optimization, landed cost analysis, and budget management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining quality standards, and supplier compliance programs, including SKU rationalization and shade consolidation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to translate complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Preferred&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sustainable fibers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of supply chain traceability including blockchain or digital tracking systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with PLM systems and quality database management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in luxury goods (apparel, home and accessories) with an eye for premium aesthetics, handfeel, and trend forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3150&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;All posted ranges are reflective of base salary and may vary depending upon experience level and location. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Bonus and equity may also be provided for eligible roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$2 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll is scaling globally, creating unique challenges and exciting opportunities to delight millions of anime fans worldwide. The Partner Engineering team, part of the larger Ecosystem Engineering organization, works with our growing network of partners and internal teams to ensure an exceptional experience for all Crunchyroll fans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Partner Engineer, you&#39;ll lead strategic technical integrations, optimize deployment processes, and collaborate with key partners to deliver outstanding user experiences. You&#39;ll act as the technical point of contact for our partners, driving innovation and solving complex challenges with scalable, forward-thinking solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this high-impact role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects involving Product, Engineering, Business Development, Program Management, and Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve and scale existing partner operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and commercialize new partner-facing solutions and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate new initiatives by building and iterating through the full product development cycle, prototyping, testing, and launching successful features.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and bridge product gaps to enable seamless partner integration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Senior Manager of Partner Engineering and must be based in the London Area. This is a hybrid role with 3 days a week in the office (Tuesdays, Wednesdays, and Thursdays).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re excited about candidates who bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience building and deploying complex systems in collaboration with external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern web technologies: JavaScript, TypeScript, Node.js, HTML5, React, and WebSockets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Client/Server architectures and scalable system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building backend services and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to confidently engage both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner facing experience across technical and business domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating payment systems, metadata and other B2B APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform development experience with Android TV or browser based TV platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with embedded devices, OEMs, SoC providers, or pay TV operators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ecosystem Engineering team at Crunchyroll plays a pivotal role in enhancing and expanding our users&#39; experiences. We collaborate extensively with a diverse network of partners to integrate, test, deploy, and improve the Crunchyroll streaming application, content discovery APIs, and billing integration APIs over the entire device lifecycle using Crunchyroll tools and data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re focused on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving subscriber growth through new device integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opening new acquisition and distribution channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering high-quality, consistent user experiences across all platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovating in the highly competitive global streaming market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Situated at the crossroads of technology and business, we are dedicated to continually enabling experiences that delight anime fans across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you will love working at Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to getting to work with fun, passionate and inspired colleagues, you will also enjoy the following benefits and perks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive a great compensation package including salary plus performance bonus earning potential, paid annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off policies allowing you to take the time you need to be your whole self.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous medical, dental, vision, STD, LTD, and life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Saving Account HSA program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health care and dependent care FSA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) plan, with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer paid commuter benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support program for new parents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet insurance and some of our offices are pet friendly!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LifeAtCrunchyroll #LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About our Values&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be everything for someone rather than something for everyone and we do this by living and modeling our values in all that we do. We value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Courage. We believe that when we overcome fear, we enable our best selves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity. We are curious, which is the gateway to empathy, inclusion, and understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kaizen. We have a growth mindset committed to constant forward progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Service. We serve our community with humility, enabling joy and belonging for others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our commitment to diversity and inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission of helping people belong reflects our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion. It&#39;s just the way we do business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at Crunchyroll. Pursuant to applicable law, we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll, LLC is an independently operated joint venture between US-based Sony Pictures Entertainment, and Japan&#39;s Aniplex, a subsidiary of Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc., both subsidiaries of Tokyo-based Sony Group Corporation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Questions about Crunchyroll’s hiring process? Please check out our Hiring FAQs:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&quot;&gt;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;Candidate Privacy Policy for more information about how we process your personal information, and your data protection rights: &lt;a href=&quot;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&quot;&gt;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please beware of recent scams to online job seekers. Those applying to our job openings will only be contacted directly from ----- email account.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Silicon Valley, California, Archer is a leader in the next-gen aerospace sector building an end-to-end advanced air mobility platform that delivers air taxis, unmanned aircraft systems (“UAS”), aviation-related physical artificial intelligence (“AI”) solutions, and other technologies to customers worldwide across the commercial aerospace and defense sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our sights are set high and our problems are hard, and we believe that diversity in the workplace is what makes us smarter, drives better insights, and will ultimately lift us all to success. We are dedicated to cultivating an equitable and inclusive environment that embraces our differences, and supports and celebrates all of our team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Archer is best known for Midnight, our electric aircraft. This role isn&#39;t on that program. The AI Products Org builds consumer software for the general aviation industry. There&#39;s a lot we&#39;re not ready to talk about publicly yet, so this posting stays vague on purpose. What we can say: the products are real, they ship, and people use them every day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As the Staff Android Engineer, you&#39;ll own the Android app of a mature consumer product — one that&#39;s been featured in the app stores multiple times and has a real user base that opens it every day. The iOS and Android apps are close to feature parity, and in a couple of places Android is ahead. You&#39;d own the Android side: new features, refinements, and keeping both platforms moving together as the product evolves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own the Android app of a mature, production consumer product: new features, refinements, and keeping it in step with iOS as both evolve. You&#39;ll be reading Swift regularly, even if you never write it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Make the parity-vs-platform-convention call constantly, and defend your reasoning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ship. Play Store releases, crash triage, performance on the long tail of Android hardware — the unglamorous parts are part of the job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work on new and different projects (mobile, web apps, internal tools) as opportunities come up across the org. This is where the generalist part of your skill set earns its keep&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work the way this team works: AI-assisted development is the default here, not a novelty. We use Claude Code daily and expect you to be fluent with agentic coding tools — or to get fluent fast and honestly, we&#39;ll be able to tell which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;7+ years of software engineering experience, mostly on user-facing client software that shipped in the Play Store&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s, or equivalent experience in Computer Science&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solid Kotlin experience, and enough compose to have opinions about it&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Real 0→1 experience — you&#39;ve built the first version of something, not just contributed to a long-lived codebase someone else stood up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort with ambiguity. If you need a fully scoped program before you can start, this won&#39;t be a fit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You can write Swift, not just read it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Web frontend experience (React or similar)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Full stack experience — useful here, but not required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve shipped in a regulated or safety-adjacent industry and know how that changes engineering culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AI Products is a roughly 100-person software org inside a company of aerospace engineers, and we expect to grow substantially over the next year. You get the resources and momentum of a real org, but the products themselves are early. If you want to hear more about what we&#39;re building before you apply, you can&#39;t. Apply, and we&#39;ll tell you plenty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Information collected and processed as part of any job applications you choose to submit is subject to Archer&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://archer.com/legal/personnel-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Certain positions may be eligible for visa sponsorship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Archer is proud to be an Equal Opportunity employer committed to diversity and inclusivity in the workplace. All aspects of employment are decided on the basis of merit, qualifications, and business needs. We do not discriminate based upon race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, age, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status, gender identity or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Archer Aviation does not engage with external recruiting agencies/individual recruiters with whom it does not have a prior written agreement. Archer reserves the right to make use of any unsolicited resumes that it receives and bears no responsibility for payment of any fees asserted from the use of unsolicited resumes. If you are a recruiting agency or individual recruiter wishing to do business with Archer, please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- All employment processes are managed by the Archer People Team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Silicon Valley, California, Archer is a leader in the next-gen aerospace sector building an end-to-end advanced air mobility platform that delivers air taxis, unmanned aircraft systems (“UAS”), aviation-related physical artificial intelligence (“AI”) solutions, and other technologies to customers worldwide across the commercial aerospace and defense sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our sights are set high and our problems are hard, and we believe that diversity in the workplace is what makes us smarter, drives better insights, and will ultimately lift us all to success. We are dedicated to cultivating an equitable and inclusive environment that embraces our differences, and supports and celebrates all of our team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot; data-start=&quot;651&quot; data-end=&quot;670&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Archer is best known for Midnight, our electric aircraft. This role isn&#39;t on that program. The AI Products Org builds consumer software for the general aviation industry. There&#39;s a lot we&#39;re not ready to talk about publicly yet, so this posting stays vague on purpose. What we can say: the products are real, they ship, and people use them every day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As the Senior iOS Engineer, you&#39;ll own the iOS app of a mature consumer product — one that&#39;s been featured in the app stores multiple times and has a real user base that opens it every day. You will join a small, expert team with big ambitions, directly shaping an end-to-end product that blends artificial intelligence, aviation expertise, and seamless mobile user experience while partnering closely with our in-house designers. You&#39;ll turn complex design concepts into seamless, shippable code and help steer the future of our digital flight tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop scalable, high-performance features for iOS, iPadOS, and watchOS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with designers to build intuitive UI/UX that follows platform best practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Refactor and modularize Swift and Objective-C code to improve quality and reusability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Integrate RESTful APIs with efficient data handling and error management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Manage the full app lifecycle, including builds, certificates, and App Store submissions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews and uphold best practices in architecture, testing, and Git&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with our Backend Engineering Teams to troubleshoot issues and ensure seamless end-to-end integration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;3+ years of commercial software development experience, including the full iOS app lifecycle management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Experience writing both Swift and Objective-C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of SwiftUI, UIKit, and other core Apple frameworks (specifically MapKit or similar mapping SDKs)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Experience integrating REST APIs, with enough backend understanding to troubleshoot issues and contribute to API design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of iOS build systems, provisioning, certificates, and App Store requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in Git&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related technical field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Experience in one (or all) of the following would be advantageous:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Aviation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Network-driven application development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 2; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Experience working with Metal or OpenGL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
